  "content": "<center><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2gkYyPQ.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"283\" alt=\"ChickensShed\"></center><br>\n<center><img alt=\"neoforge\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/6bbf631df06444d1f1669f514e32bb5ab93bb0e3/assets/cozy/supported/neoforge_vector.svg\"> <img alt=\"fabric\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/fabric_vector.svg\"> <img alt=\"quilt\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/quilt_vector.svg\"> <img alt=\"forge\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/forge_vector.svg\"><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/chickensshed\"><img alt=\"modrinth\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chickensshed\"><img alt=\"curseforge\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\"></a></center><br>\n\n## 📖 關於\n\nChickensShed 主要讓雞隻偶爾掉落羽毛，讓玩家無需殺雞即可獲得羽毛。此模組也允許玩家自由調整掉落的物品，並可設定哪些生物會掉落該物品。\n\n內建相容於 **Supplementaries** 的籠子與罐子。\n\n## ⚙️ 設定\n\n目前 ChickensShed 的設定提供以下選項：\n- 切換幼年生物是否掉落物品；\n- 調整物品從生物身上掉落的頻率；\n- 設定哪些生物會掉落該物品；\n- 個別為不同生物指定掉落的物品。\n\n在 **Fabric**/**Quilt** 上需安裝 **[Forge Config API Port](https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port)**。",
